{"about_the_game":"Oh no, you got hit by a truck and died.<br>Fortunately you have been reincarnated as a dungeon core!<br>All you know is what's inside your dungeon domain.<br>All you want is to grow stronger and expand your dungeon.<br><br>A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental management game.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Lure raiders into your dungeon with Loot<br>Upgrade your core, it is your last line of defense<br>Gather Knowledge to unlock new features<br>Discover and summon minions to defend you dungeon and upgrade them<br>Place your individual minions freely inside your dungeon<br>Create new dungeon floors<br>(WIP) Refine your mana and unlock new skills<br>(WIP) Send your minions on expeditions to bring back powerful idols or new items to research<br>(WIP) Modify your core with idols and create powerful effect","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944490?t=1767790716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767790716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767790716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767790716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Oh no, you got hit by a truck and died.<br>Fortunately you have been reincarnated as a dungeon core!<br>All you know is what's inside your dungeon domain.<br>All you want is to grow stronger and expand your dungeon.<br><br>A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental management game.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Lure raiders into your dungeon with Loot<br>Upgrade your core, it is your last line of defense<br>Gather Knowledge to unlock new features<br>Discover and summon minions to defend you dungeon and up